sequenceDiagram
    actor Emp as Employee
    participant CON as Consent Service
    participant TEMP as Temporal
    participant PROF as Profile Service
    participant RISK as Risk Engine
    participant INT as Intervention
    participant RPT as Reporting
    participant AUD as Audit Service
    participant S3 as S3 Storage

    Emp->>CON: POST erasure-request
    CON->>TEMP: Start ErasureWorkflow
    CON-->>Emp: 202 Accepted — target 72h

    TEMP->>PROF: Anonymise PII
    TEMP->>RISK: Pseudonymise risk data
    TEMP->>INT: Anonymise trainer notes
    TEMP->>RPT: Redact from reports
    TEMP->>AUD: Record erasure event
    TEMP->>S3: Generate deletion certificate
    TEMP->>CON: status = COMPLETED
    CON-->>Emp: Certificate download link
